        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 19432, Traditional Solid Brass Narrow Plate Egg Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSometimes the simplest designs are the most pleasing as is the case with the Traditional Solid Brass Narrow Plate Knobset. The Egg Knob with Oval Narrow Plate features clean lines with a traditional style. It is available in polished brass, polished chrome, and shaded bronze. For interior doors with 1-3/8\" thicknesses and either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C16RC1_size.gif?v=1704354529\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Narrow Plate Egg Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Egg Knob with Oval Narrow Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>All critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout.</li>\r\n<li>For commercial and residential use.</li>\r\n<li>For interior use only.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy function features a privacy mortise bolt constructed of a metal case and featuring a solid brass bolt underneath the knob and latch. It has an emergency release on outside plate.</li>\r\n<li>The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. <b>Does Not</b> fit standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Interior Oval Narrow Rose with Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 9-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Privacy Function Turnpiece: 1-5/8\" x 1-1/8 proj.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy</b>: For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 1 knob, 1 backplate, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 2 knobs, 2 backplates, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates by knob from either side of door. Complete set includes: 2 knobs, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, tubular latch, spindle and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Upper latch operates by knob from either side of door. Locks by privacy bolt with turnpiece on inside an emergency release on outside plate. Complete set includes: 2 knobs, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, spindle, mounting hardware, privacy turnpiece, knob operated tubular latch, and thumbturn operated privacy mortise bolt and case.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LCN-3133-closer-size.gif?v=1704354671\" width=\"260\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg Knob with Oval Narrow Plate",
                "description": "Traditional Solid Brass Narrow Plate Knobset Omnia 19432 - Sometimes the simplest designs are the most pleasing as is the case with the Traditional Solid Brass Narrow Plate Knobset. The Egg Knob with Oval Narrow Plate features clean lines with a traditional style. It is available in polished brass, polished chrome, and shaded bronze. For interior doors with 1-3/8 inch thicknesses and either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
